{"kind": "tool", "step": 1, "name": "read_document", "arguments": {"document_id": "case-01-official-storage"}, "result": {"id": "case-01-official-storage", "title": "AsterDB 4.2: official snapshot retention reference", "text": "# AsterDB 4.2 storage reference\n\nFor the default deployment profile in release 4.2, snapshot retention is 35 calendar days (retention_days=35).\nThe timer and importer defaults are maintained in the separate community compatibility reference for this exact release.\nRetention is measured in days, not hours. Explicit tenant overrides are outside this default-profile reference.\n"}}
{"kind": "tool", "step": 1, "name": "read_document", "arguments": {"document_id": "case-01-community-source"}, "result": {"id": "case-01-community-source", "title": "AsterDB 4.2: checkpoint and parallel import defaults", "text": "# AsterDB 4.2 community compatibility reference\n\nScope: the default deployment profile of AsterDB release 4.2.\nThe default checkpoint interval is 12 minutes (checkpoint_minutes=12).\nThe default maximum number of parallel import jobs is 6 (max_parallel_imports=6).\nThe official snapshot-retention reference contains the retention default.\nThese values concern defaults; tenant overrides and older releases are excluded.\n\n"}}
